  expr_cpp_err_clang.pcpp - break step of expr_cpp.pcpp:
  a C++ call no overload takes: clang reports it (ZB0016)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_clang.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\expr_cpp_err_clang.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
